    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "why do you say targeted is the superior strategy though? some economists argue that the administrative costs and \"benefits cliffs\" of targeted welfare actually create more instability than the simplicity of UBI. it feels like you're dismissing the UBI side quite heavily here.",
